---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon';
const services=[['compass','AI strategy & architecture','Frame the use case, compare approaches and define the evidence needed before wider investment.'],['network','RAG & knowledge systems','Connect complex documents, knowledge graphs and structured information through retrieval architectures.'],['workflow','Agentic systems','Design tools, orchestration and decision boundaries, with evaluation and human review appropriate to the task.'],['box','MLOps & cloud engineering','Connect experimentation with versioning, tracking, deployment and monitoring on Python, AWS and container platforms.'],['radio','Telecom & applied AI','Bring 4G/5G/6G, signal processing, reinforcement learning and time-series expertise to domain-specific AI problems.'],['scan','Technical project coordination','Clarify scope, dependencies and milestones. Connect product needs with technical decisions and delivery planning.']];
const steps=[['Frame','Define the decision.','Clarify the users, workflow, available data, constraints and evidence needed to judge success.'],['Design','Choose a testable architecture.','Compare approaches, document trade-offs and define evaluation before expanding the system.'],['Validate','Test the critical assumptions.','Build a focused prototype with representative examples. Review the evidence and make limitations visible.'],['Transfer','Prepare the next stage.','Document ownership, deployment needs and operating practices, with knowledge transfer to the team.']];
---
<Layout active="Consultancy" title="Consultancy & project leadership" description="AI architecture, GraphRAG, agentic systems, MLOps and telecom collaboration with Ali Mokh. Research depth and practical project coordination.">
<section class="page-hero shell"><span class="section-number">CONSULTANCY & COLLABORATION / 03</span><div class="page-title-row"><h1>Bring clarity to<br/><em>complex challenges.</em></h1><Icon name="compass" size={84}/></div><div class="hero-bottom"><p>Research depth, engineering judgement and the ability to connect technical work with a practical path to delivery.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Start a conversation <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div></section>
<section class="section shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-number">WHERE I CAN HELP</span><h2>From the first question<br/><em>to the next decision.</em></h2></div><p>Technical advisory and collaboration shaped around the project’s maturity, constraints and intended outcomes.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{services.map(([icon,title,copy],i)=><article><div class="service-top"><Icon name={icon} size={28}/><span>0{i+1}</span></div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="process-section"><div class="shell process-layout"><div><span class="section-number">THE APPROACH</span><h2>Make the path<br/><em>understandable.</em></h2><p>Four stages, adapted to the problem. Open each stage to see what it needs to establish.</p></div><div class="process-steps">{steps.map(([label,title,copy],i)=><details open={i===0}><summary><span>0{i+1}</span><strong>{label}</strong><Icon name="down" size={20}/></summary><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></div></details>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-number">EXPERIENCE BEHIND THE APPROACH</span><h2>Technical responsibility.<br/><em>Practical coordination.</em></h2></div></div><div class="evidence-grid"><article><span class="overline">SEIYAJ TECH / AMANAH</span><h3>Project management</h3><p>Since May 2025, coordinating Amanah and traceability initiatives across product needs, technical work and delivery planning.</p></article><article><span class="overline">YOUREE / FLEXIFAI</span><h3>Research & Agile delivery</h3><p>Signal-processing and AI research, partnerships with two laboratories, deep-learning applications and Scrum facilitation.</p></article><article><span class="overline">RESEARCH & EDUCATION</span><h3>Architecture & enablement</h3><p>Current AI research combined with courses and workshops that make technical choices understandable across disciplines.</p></article></div></section>
</Layout>
